{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35213","headline":"客有追叹後时者作诗勉之 · 聂夷中","name":"客有追叹後时者作诗勉之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"後达多晚荣，速得多疾倾。\n君看构大厦，何曾一日成。\n在暖须在桑，在饱须在耕。\n君子贵弘道，道弘无不亨。\n太阳垂好光，毛髪悉见形。\n我亦二十年，直似戴盆行。\n荆山产美玉，石石皆坚贞。\n未必尽有玉，玉且间石生。\n精卫一微物，犹恐填海平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}